  "architecture_decision": "Export requests capture an immutable structured definition and explicit safe field layout. Creation requires BULK_EXPORT permission; materialization re-runs the definition through current visible leads, writes bounded CSV/XLSX bytes with formula neutralization, records checksum/audit metadata, and expires access without deleting the audit row.",
